        {
          "host": "B",
          "text": "What do we flag?"
        },
        {
          "host": "A",
          "text": "It's a preprint, not peer reviewed, and the headline multiple is the authors' own and not independently verified. There's also a dating wrinkle we'll be straight about: the archive record was approved on September 27th, but the same paper went up on arXiv on September 24th, before our window."
        }
