      "headline": "Washington Post: US and Russia stripped the human-review requirement from the UN draft autonomous-weapons framework",
      "lines": [
        {
          "host": "A",
          "text": "The Washington Post reported on Saturday that on the final day of talks in Switzerland, over roughly 15 hours, US and Russian diplomats removed provisions from the draft framework on lethal autonomous weapons. One required that humans review military targets developed by AI before a strike."
